      "updated": 1788870719876,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here, we have an AI chat screen, a Terminal, a place to writre the code, and a place to preview the code.\nThe user can talk to AI and can make changes in code, and as the changes in the code happens, the user\ncan chekc out the output of the code in preview. The user can also access our terminal",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here, we have an AI chat screen, a Terminal, a place to writre the code, and a place to preview the code.\nThe user can talk to AI and can make changes in code, and as the changes in the code happens, the user\ncan chekc out the output of the code in preview. The user can also access our terminal",
